[Host] Now let's break it down, sentence by sentence.

13
00:02:28,635 --> 00:02:42,075
[Slow] 昨日、8月8日は、令和8年8月8日でした。「8」が三つ並ぶ、特別な日でした。

14
00:02:42,876 --> 00:02:52,403
[Host] Yesterday, August eighth, was year eight, month eight, day eight in the Japanese calendar. It was a special day with three eights in a row.

